CouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.6.stable, 4.6.1.stable\n\nI'm pretty sure that this issue should be present in the later versions, at least from changelog\nI may not be able to migrate easily\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Windows 10 (build 19044) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 31.0.15.1659) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800H with Radeon Graphics (16 threads) - 13.85 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI have to load dozens of save files, which I do from a scoped storage uri. It takes around half a second to open each, even when files do not exist, meaning it takes dozens of seconds every time to start the game. I was surprised to find out that user directory loads instantaneously.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open an MRP\n2. Launch and point to any free directory\n3. Observe how SAF is three orders of magnitude slower\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[saf-load.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31338791/saf-load.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122726/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122726/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}